0:38Z","closed_at":"2026-08-26T14:33:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nissue in v4.7.rc1.official [a4f5e8cdd]\nIt behaves correctly in v4.6.3.stable.steam [7d41c59c4]<br/><br/><br/>\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.3.stable (7d41c59c4) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Ti Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1047) - 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-11800H @ 2.30GHz (16 threads) - 15.78 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/433c7d0d-be0a-40f5-ab89-1eed38abce9a\" />\nThis is UV1 in Blender.<br/><br/><br/>\n\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8a78714-628d-4c29-bc52-cd512d11e3d6\" />\nand this is UV3 in Blender.\nThe UV2 is the same as UV1 and it doesn't matter if the fourth uv is present or not.<br/><br/><br/>\n\n\n<img width=\"620\" height=\"692\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/75474203-b588-4c30-9060-d5706711b3d2\" /><br/>\nThis is default UV1 from Godot and it's different from the Blender's. As you can see, it's actually UV3 from Blender, not Blender UV1.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDefine more than 3 UVs and use the CUSTOM data from shader to access it.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[extra-uv-issue-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28829179/extra-uv-issue-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"floweeng","id":104648756,"node_id":"U_kgDOBjzQNA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104648756?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/floweeng","html_url":"https://github.